    { "dot": "cyan", "title": "How it serves a school", "items": [
      "RSC dashboards stream real numbers on first paint — skeletons, never spinners",
      "The 3-tap law: ≤5 nav targets per role; every tool within 3 taps",
      "One question per screen — the dashboard answers it with live data first"
    ] },
    { "dot": "emerald", "title": "How it stays honest", "items": [
      "One FIFO fee waterfall powers parent, bursar, print and PDF — one ledger, no arguments",
