      "Print & PDF service renders A4 receipts, statements, report cards and the BOM pack from the same data",
      "AI drafts only (anomaly flags, remarks) — humans approve; it never touches money"
    ] },
    { "dot": "rose", "title": "How it isolates & works offline", "items": [
